{"title":"Northeastern WOOTers Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Northeastern_WOOTers_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be real numbers. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5dbfe732cf4879ca7647d91ad0860229ee0436d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+2y^2+3z^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />, the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/f/41fcae6e0b0c7f3f9ee2755f339602ce70e10ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( 3x+2y+z \\right)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"21\" /> can be represented <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f583697295fc6f723862c13228ee55107c33ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are positive integers, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Northeastern_WOOTers_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cauchy-Schwarz_Inequality\" title=\"Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality\">Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/3627c5ac16d8502890bd525bc4a15566db63e6ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x^2 + 2y^2 + 3z^2)(9 + 2 + \\frac{1}{3}) \\geq \\left( 3x + 2y + z \\right)^2.\\]\" width=\"361\" height=\"37\" />\nIt follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3de47381b4b8ea676cd1263ed775fe5bd6e26012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( 3x + 2y + z \\right)^2 \\leq \\frac{34}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" />. Since this is attainable when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/d/d5d07d5a907b8dd0a465fd4952910d5d002efe72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2}{9} = \\frac{2y^2}{2} = \\frac{3z^2}{1/3} \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{9}{\\sqrt{102}}, y = \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{102}}, z = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{102}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"419\" height=\"45\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/6/3f6caa8e9e99e5a1281c4c0c38640f5557169821.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$34 + 3 = \\boxed{037}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"114\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041044\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 72/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2878/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21803:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041044 and revision id 159737. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}